# The Human Priest spell quests: Divine Grace at 10 (94773, new in Forever)
# and Arcane Feedback at 20 (5676), both from High Priestess Laurena in
# Stormwind's Cathedral of Light.
# Sources: quests.json and npcs.json for the givers; Forever's
# Priest class quest list (data/local/quest-audit/):
# Divine Grace (94773-94779) is new, Arcane Feedback unchanged; Forever's
# quest data for Laurena (npc 376, checked
# 2026-10-14) lists both as starting and ending with her.
# Desperate Prayer is not in this guide: Forever's quest data lists Humans as
# well as Dwarves for some of its quests (5635, 5637, 5639), so it is in
# desperate-prayer-and-chastise, which is for both races. Third-party
# Forever sites (classicwowforever.com/racials) say Humans no longer learn
# the spell; the quest data does not confirm that either way.
# alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest and 02-westfall carry Divine Grace on the
# route (94774, from Priestess Josetta in Goldshire) and
# alliance/04-redridge-mountains carries Arcane Feedback; this guide repeats
# them for anyone off the route. Priest trainers in other cities send you to
# Laurena with a quest of the same name; the game offers one of each set.
# Not checked in game: written from the sources above.

step Divine Grace
  tip At 10, go to High Priestess Laurena in the Cathedral of Light. Priestess Josetta in Goldshire sends you to her with a quest of the same name.
  level 10
  accept 94773                                -- High Priestess Laurena
  turnin 94773                                -- High Priestess Laurena: Divine Grace

step Arcane Feedback
  tip At 20, High Priestess Laurena teaches Feedback. High Priest Rohan in Ironforge and Priestess Alathea in Darnassus send you to her with a quest of the same name.
  level 20
  accept 5676                                 -- High Priestess Laurena
  turnin 5676                                 -- High Priestess Laurena: Feedback
